WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:05.430
Dr. Artium placed one biography about the
late comic book writer Stan Lee, and one Lenovo

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.420
Laptop, into the Clockworks on Very Fine.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.129
The result was that the top of the laptop
seemed to be replaced with the original cover

00:00:12.129 --> 00:00:18.030
material of said book, all Lenovo logos on
the laptop were replaced with the word "excelsior".

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:22.390
On starting up the laptop researchers were
met with an animated humanoid on screen who

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:24.120
resembled Stan Lee.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.290
The humanoid was able to speak and respond
to questions asked of it and several questions

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.230
related to the life of "Stan Lee" were answered
accurately.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.000
Dr. Artium noted, “I need to go and cry
for a minute, excuse me!”

